<title>ESTONIA: BALTIKA TO PAY 20 EEK PER SHARE DIVIDEND-REPORT.</title>
<headline>BALTIKA TO PAY 20 EEK PER SHARE DIVIDEND-REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltika, an unlisted clothing manufacturer and retailer, said that it will pay 20 kroons per share in dividends, Aripaev business daily said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The shareholder meeting approved the decision in a meeting on Tuesday which sees the company paying the same amount in dividend as last year, the paper said.</p>
<p>The shareholders also decided to change the companies articles of association so that the company's stock can be freely traded, the paper said.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
